comments:
A Testament to Brotherhood and Cooperation
@TamimBinHamad
 @HassanSMohamud
The conversation between President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud and His Highness Sheikh Tamim bin Hamad Al Thani is a testament to the enduring brotherhood between Somalia and Qatar.

When nations engage in dialogue with sincerity and vision, they build not just diplomatic ties, but a legacy of unity, progress, and mutual prosperity.

May this exchange strengthen the bonds between our people, open new avenues for collaboration, and serve as a reminder that true leadership is found in those who uplift others.

The future belongs to those who invest in friendship, cooperation, and shared aspirations. 
@Imaan_Elman
I hope you're happy you understand that I'm not just the most powerful citizen now I'm the richest;أجرى فخامة الرئيس الدكتور حسن شيخ محمود، اليوم، اتصالًا هاتفياً بأخيه صاحب السمو الشيخ تميم بن حمد آل ثاني، أمير دولة قطر الشقيقة.

وتناول الجانبان خلال الاتصال سبل تعزيز العلاقات الأخوية بين البلدين في مختلف المجالات، مؤكدين حرصهما على تطوير التعاون الثنائي بما يلبّي تطلعات

